# Notely Logic Implementation Plan

> **Workflow**: Follow [conductor/workflow.md](file:///d:/gemini_cli/conductor/workflow.md) — TDD (Red→Green→Refactor), phase checkpoints, quality gates.
> **Execute ALL logic phases before starting UI plan.**

