## Phase 1: Theme Tokens & Constants

Goal: Prepare design system tokens from [product-guidelines.md](file:///d:/gemini_cli/conductor/product-guidelines.md) without UI changes.

- [ ] Task: Create `ColorsManager` in `lib/constants/colors_manager.dart`
  - Primary: `#f9f506` (vibrant yellow)
  - Dark backgrounds: `#23220f`, `#2f2e1a`
  - Light/Dark variants for all UI elements
- [ ] Task: Create `TextStyles` in `lib/constants/text_styles.dart`
  - Use `google_fonts` with Spline Sans for headers, Inter for body
  - All sizes use `.sp` from `flutter_screenutil`
  - Follow naming: `font24YellowBold`, `font16GrayRegular`, etc.
- [ ] Task: Add route constants to [lib/constants/padge_routs.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/constants/padge_routs.dart)
  - `favouritesRoute = '/favourites'`
  - `settingsRoute = '/settings'`
  - `accountRoute = '/account'`
  - `searchRoute = '/search'`
- [ ] **Acceptance**: Files compile, tokens importable, no runtime errors

