## Phase 2: Database & Model Layer

Goal: Add `is_favorite` field with proper migration and testing.

- [ ] Task: Write failing tests for isFavorite field
  - Test [DatabaseNote](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/services/crud/note_services.dart#436-473) parses `is_favorite` from row
  - Test creating note defaults to `isFavorite = false`
  - Test toggle changes flag
- [ ] Task: Implement DB migration in [lib/services/crud/note_services.dart](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/services/crud/note_services.dart)
  - Bump `dbVersion` (1 → 2)
  - Add `onUpgrade` handler with ALTER TABLE
  - Column: `is_favorite INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0`
- [ ] Task: Update [DatabaseNote](file:///d:/gemini_cli/Notely/lib/services/crud/note_services.dart#436-473) model
  - Add `final bool isFavorite` field
  - Update `fromRow()` factory
- [ ] Task: Run tests — verify all pass
- [ ] **Acceptance**: DB opens without crash, existing notes preserved, tests green

