## Phase Verification Checklist

Before starting UI plan, verify per [conductor/workflow.md](file:///d:/gemini_cli/conductor/workflow.md):

- [ ] All unit tests pass
- [ ] Code coverage >80% for new code
- [ ] App launches without DB crash
- [ ] Existing notes load correctly with `isFavorite = false`
- [ ] Firestore console shows `is_favorite` field
- [ ] `ColorsManager` and `TextStyles` importable
- [ ] Route constants defined

